me time to help me to invest some of my share of the money in a lucrative business in your country. Please get back to me via my private email address(Davidic_bala@yahoo)for better discussion or should Incas you have any questions you would like to ask, please feel free to contact me any time via my email address. Thanks and God bless as I will be looking forward to your swift and positive response. Regards, MR.DAVID. R.BAIL",d08,Government and Legal Affairs,"GENERAL SETTINGS
