d the balance of 5%for will be responsible for the major /trivial expenses incurred in the course of the transaction. There is no risk involved in this project army position in my bank and with the aid of my personal lawyer alldocumentswill be provided to make you the legal beneficiary and the legality of this project will correspond with local and international laws of inheritance. If you are interested, please reply immediately. Upon your response, Shall then provide you with further information's and modalities that will help you understand the transaction. You should observe utmost confidentiality, and be rest assured that this project would be most profitable for both parties because I shall require your assistance to invest my share in your country. Awaiting your urgent reply. Thanks and regards. Mr. Africa Tantiworawong",d11,Education and Training,"GENERAL SETTINGS
