 guarantee the successful execution of this deal.  I wish to point out that after the claims, I would want 20% of this money to be shared among charity organizations, while the remaining 80% is shared equally between us. Most importantly, I would also require your assistance towards investing my share in your country or anywhere as you may advise. If you are interested, please contact me immediately. Upon your response, I shall provide you with more details and how we shall proceed with the claims. I expect you to observe utmost confidentiality and be rest assured that this transaction would be profitable for both of us.  I strongly believe every information is given for you to access my status before any further interactions.  Furthermore, I go on anticipating your urgent co-operation.  Thanks & Regards Barr. Khan A. Farad 				---------------------------------Get your own web address for just $1.99/1st yr. We'll help. Yahoo! Small Business.",d11,Education and Training,"GENERAL SETTINGS
